  "description": "Meet Buby, a playful graffiti bubble font filled with bold, cheerful, and creative personality. Its chunky hand-drawn letterforms are perfect for kids’ designs, T-shirts, stickers, posters, classroom projects, birthday invitations, product packaging, social media graphics, and more.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• Buby Main Font — OTF and TTF\n• 4 Color Bitmap Fonts (Bonus Files)\n• 4 Sets of Color PNG Alphabet Files (Bonus Files)\nThe four colorful bonus styles include pink, blue, green, and purple.\nIMPORTANT — PLEASE READ \nThe Color Bitmap Fonts are bonus files and require compatible software to display their full-color appearance. They are supported in applications such as Adobe Photoshop CC 2017 or later, Adobe Illustrator CC 2018 or later, Adobe InDesign CC 2019 or later, and supported native macOS applications such as Font Book, Pages, and Keynote.\nColor Bitmap Fonts may not display correctly in older Adobe software or in applications that do not support color fonts. Please check that your software supports Color Bitmap Fonts before purchasing.\nIf your software does not support the Color Bitmap Fonts, you can use the four included PNG Alphabet Sets as an alternative. The PNG letters are individual image files and are not installable or typeable fonts.\nThe main Buby font is included in both OTF and TTF formats and can be installed for regular typing.\nThank you for supporting my creative font designs!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Meet Buby, a playful graffiti bubble font filled with bold, cheerful, and creative personality. Its chunky hand-drawn letterforms are perfect for kids’ designs, T-shirts, stickers, posters, classroom projects, birthday invitations, product packaging, social media graphics, and more.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED<br>\n• Buby Main Font — OTF and TTF<br>\n• 4 Color Bitmap Fonts (Bonus Files)<br>\n• 4 Sets of Color PNG Alphabet Files (Bonus Files)</p>\n<p>The four colorful bonus styles include pink, blue, green, and purple.</p>\n<p>IMPORTANT — PLEASE READ </p>\n<p>The Color Bitmap Fonts are bonus files and require compatible software to display their full-color appearance. They are supported in applications such as Adobe Photoshop CC 2017 or later, Adobe Illustrator CC 2018 or later, Adobe InDesign CC 2019 or later, and supported native macOS applications such as Font Book, Pages, and Keynote.</p>\n<p>Color Bitmap Fonts may not display correctly in older Adobe software or in applications that do not support color fonts. Please check that your software supports Color Bitmap Fonts before purchasing.</p>\n<p>If your software does not support the Color Bitmap Fonts, you can use the four included PNG Alphabet Sets as an alternative. The PNG letters are individual image files and are not installable or typeable fonts.</p>\n<p>The main Buby font is included in both OTF and TTF formats and can be installed for regular typing.</p>\n<p>Thank you for supporting my creative font designs!</p>",
